{"version":4,"id":"d_g7cbYVmrpTbt","name":"Tri-state bus","nodes":{"n_d0":{"id":"n_d0","type":"io.switch","position":{"x":110,"y":240},"label":"Data 0","params":{"width":1,"value":1}},"n_en0":{"id":"n_en0","type":"io.switch","position":{"x":110,"y":310},"label":"Enable 0","params":{"width":1,"value":1}},"n_d1":{"id":"n_d1","type":"io.switch","position":{"x":110,"y":460},"label":"Data 1","params":{"width":1,"value":0}},"n_en1":{"id":"n_en1","type":"io.switch","position":{"x":110,"y":530},"label":"Enable 1","params":{"width":1,"value":0}},"n_ts0":{"id":"n_ts0","type":"gate.tristate","position":{"x":320,"y":240},"params":{"width":1}},"n_ts1":{"id":"n_ts1","type":"gate.tristate","position":{"x":320,"y":460},"params":{"width":1}},"n_led":{"id":"n_led","type":"io.led","position":{"x":580,"y":240},"label":"Bus","params":{"color":"green"}},"n_probe":{"id":"n_probe","type":"io.probe","position":{"x":570,"y":350},"label":"Bus value","params":{"width":1,"radix":"binary"}},"n_grp_drv0":{"id":"n_grp_drv0","type":"deco.group","position":{"x":80,"y":170},"params":{"title":"Driver 0","subtitle":"Data, and the enable that lets it out","color":"blue","style":"filled","fontSize":11,"carry":true,"width":32,"height":21}},"n_grp_drv1":{"id":"n_grp_drv1","type":"deco.group","position":{"x":80,"y":390},"params":{"title":"Driver 1","subtitle":"The same again, onto the same wire","color":"purple","style":"filled","fontSize":11,"carry":true,"width":32,"height":21}},"n_grp_bus":{"id":"n_grp_bus","type":"deco.group","position":{"x":510,"y":170},"params":{"title":"The shared net","subtitle":"One wire, two drivers, no referee","color":"amber","style":"filled","fontSize":11,"carry":true,"width":17,"height":28}},"n_note_try":{"id":"n_note_try","type":"deco.text","position":{"x":700,"y":170},"params":{"text":"## Try it\n1. **Enable 0** on, **Enable 1** off — bus = **Data 0**.\n2. Swap the enables — the bus follows **Data 1**.\n3. **Both off**: nobody drives, the probe reads `Z`.\n4. **Both on**, data differing: the probe reads `X`.","format":"markdown","fontSize":12,"align":"left","color":"default","background":"none","width":36,"height":11}},"n_note_zx":{"id":"n_note_zx","type":"deco.text","position":{"x":700,"y":310},"params":{"text":"### Z is not 0\n`Z` means *not driving at all*, which is what\nlets several outputs share one net — as long as\nno more than one of them is ever enabled.\n\n`X` is the simulator saying the question has no\nanswer. A real bus in that state burns current\nthrough both drivers. The lamp cannot show\neither value, which is why the probe beside it\nspells the bus out in full.","format":"markdown","fontSize":12,"align":"left","color":"default","background":"none","width":36,"height":17}},"n_grp_all":{"id":"n_grp_all","type":"deco.group","position":{"x":60,"y":100},"params":{"title":"Tri-state bus","subtitle":"Two drivers sharing one net, with Z and X","color":"teal","style":"filled","fontSize":16,"carry":true,"width":102,"height":52}}},"wires":{"w_01":{"id":"w_01","from":{"nodeId":"n_d0","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_ts0","pinId":"in"}},"w_02":{"id":"w_02","from":{"nodeId":"n_en0","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_ts0","pinId":"en"},"waypoints":[{"x":260,"y":330},{"x":260,"y":220},{"x":350,"y":220}]},"w_03":{"id":"w_03","from":{"nodeId":"n_d1","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_ts1","pinId":"in"}},"w_04":{"id":"w_04","from":{"nodeId":"n_en1","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_ts1","pinId":"en"},"waypoints":[{"x":260,"y":550},{"x":260,"y":440},{"x":350,"y":440}]},"w_05":{"id":"w_05","from":{"nodeId":"n_ts0","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_led","pinId":"in"}},"w_06":{"id":"w_06","from":{"nodeId":"n_ts0","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_probe","pinId":"in"},"waypoints":[{"x":460,"y":260},{"x":460,"y":370}]},"w_07":{"id":"w_07","from":{"nodeId":"n_ts1","pinId":"out"},"to":{"nodeId":"n_probe","pinId":"in"},"waypoints":[{"x":460,"y":480},{"x":460,"y":370}]}}}